    <dcterms:rights>Link / Signpost Only</dcterms:rights>
    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://www.programedukacjionkologicznej.pl/uploads/PEO_RZR_Poradnik13_www.pdf"/>
    <dcterms:title>Życie po nowotworze: Poradnik dla osób po przebytej chorobie</dcterms:title>
    <edu:accessConditions>Public</edu:accessConditions>
    <edu:applicabilityNotes>Broad survivorship guide rather than an AYA-specific publication. Signpost relevant sections of the 52-page document. Check current clinical and local service applicability before approval. Translation permission stated by this publisher does not establish permission for MAYA to reproduce, adapt or ingest the Polish text.</edu:applicabilityNotes>
