    <rdfs:label>Campanha DGS de 1 de abril - "Mito ou verdade: o que prefere partilhar?"</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:description>Brief guidance on recognising health misinformation by checking who produced a claim, what its content and evidence show, and when it was published. Encourages verification before sharing health information.</dcterms:description>
