    <dcterms:title>Relationships after cancer treatment</dcterms:title>
    <edu:accessConditions>Public</edu:accessConditions>
    <edu:applicabilityNotes>Youth-focused survivorship guidance addressing relationship adjustment and communication. Includes discussing treatment-related fertility effects with a partner, rather than detailed fertility guidance.</edu:applicabilityNotes>
