    <rdfs:label>Come affrontare i sintomi più comuni della malattia e gli effetti collaterali delle terapie</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:description>Explains common cancer symptoms and treatment effects, including fatigue, eating difficulties, neuropathy, sleep problems and pain. Includes sleep-diary guidance to support discussion of sleep difficulties with a clinician.</dcterms:description>
    <dcterms:identifier>MAYA-EDU-0181</dcterms:identifier>
