    <rdfs:label>Krebs im Internet: So finden Sie gute Informationen</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:description>Two-page leaflet explaining how to assess online cancer information, check sources and authorship, interpret social-media and AI-generated content, and limit disclosure of personal information.</dcterms:description>
