    <rdfs:label>8 consejos para gestionar el estrés cuando convives con el cáncer</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:description>Explains stress associated with cancer and presents eight practical strategies for managing daily demands, supporting emotional wellbeing and seeking help from others.</dcterms:description>
