    <dcterms:title>¿Y después del cáncer, qué?</dcterms:title>
    <edu:accessConditions>Public</edu:accessConditions>
    <edu:applicabilityNotes>General survivorship resource, not AYA-specific. Educational content can support adjustment after treatment. References to Kālida courses and services require separate confirmation of availability and eligibility.</edu:applicabilityNotes>
